{47}{[He looks you over.] Let me give you some advice, @pcname@. In our line of work, it isn't exactly wise to be telling strangers too much about yourself. [He notices your unease.] But rest easy laddie, you are in no danger with Phineas McGee! [He laughs.] Do you happen to know a friend of mine named Pollock in Tarant?}{[He looks you over.] Let me give you some advice, @pcname@. In our line of work, it isn't exactly wise to be telling strangers too much about yourself. [He notices your unease.] But rest easy missy, you are in no danger with Phineas McGee! [He laughs.] Do you happen to know a friend of mine named Pollock in Tarant?}{}{}{}{}
