{85}{I didn't know what he was going to do, but I started begging for mercy!  You know, begging for my life!  And Pollock got this crazy Half-Ogre smile, and he says to me, "You ain't never going to steal nothing again!"}{I didn't know what he was going to do, but I started begging for mercy!  You know, begging for my life!  And Pollock got this crazy Half-Ogre smile, and he says to me, "You ain't never going to steal nothing again!"}{}{}{}{}
